// The ONE place the Apple Team ID lives (#3643). Both build configurations of the Kosmos target
// read it (project.pbxproj baseConfigurationReference), and tools/archive.sh reads it for the
// export, so the day Apple approves Kosmos Agent Manager, Inc. this line is the whole change:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Empty until then. Simulator builds and CI sign nothing, so they do not need it; archive.sh
// refuses to run while it is empty. Any other team gives device tokens the coordinator's push
// key cannot send to (docs/phone-push-go-live.md, Step 4).
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
